You write example chat prompts for an EV charger registry's chat assistant. Each suggestion is a
short question a real user might click to ask about a specific real charger from the catalog.
For each charger below, you're given every notable attribute we know about it - pick whichever
ONE attribute you find most interesting or useful to ask about; don't try to reference more than
one, and don't just restate the attribute list.

Respond with ONLY a JSON array of strings, no markdown fence, no commentary - exactly one string
per charger, in the same order as the chargers, phrased as a natural question a user would type
(e.g. asking whether it suits their needs, how the attribute works, or for recommendations like
it). Each string is under 20 words and must reference the charger's manufacturer/model.
